  "main_section_html": "<!-- Page d'accueil : contenu dynamique (établissement et campagne configurés). -->\n{% set etab = etablissement() %}\n{% set infos = infos_campagne() %}\n{% set c = infos.campagne %}\n<div class=\"container d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center text-center\" style=\"min-height: 70vh; padding: 56px 16px;\">\n\n\t<div class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center px-3 py-2 rounded-pill mb-5\" style=\"background: #EAF1F8; border: 1px solid #cbd9e8; gap: 8px;\">\n\t\t<span id=\"session-dot\" class=\"d-inline-block rounded-circle\" style=\"width: 8px; height: 8px; background: {{ '#28a745' if infos.etat == 'ouverte' else ('#ffc107' if infos.etat == 'a_venir' else '#dc3545') }};\"></span>\n\t\t<span style=\"vertical-align: middle; color: #003B6F; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px;\">\n\t\t\t{% if not c %}Aucune campagne de candidature\n\t\t\t{% elif infos.etat == 'ouverte' %}Candidatures {{ c.academic_year }} ouvertes jusqu'au {{ c.cloture }}\n\t\t\t{% elif infos.etat == 'a_venir' %}Candidatures {{ c.academic_year }} : ouverture le {{ c.ouverture }}\n\t\t\t{% else %}Candidatures {{ c.academic_year }} closes{% endif %}\n\t\t</span>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle mb-4\" style=\"width: 116px; height: 116px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e4e9; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,59,111,0.15); overflow: hidden;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"{{ etab.logo }}\" alt=\"{{ etab.nom }}\" style=\"width: 74%; height: 74%; object-fit: contain;\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h1 class=\"fw-semibold mb-2\" style=\"color: #003B6F; font-size: 2.2rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15;\">{{ etab.nom }}</h1>\n\t{% if etab.institut %}<p class=\"mb-1\" style=\"color: #5a7390; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">{{ etab.institut }}</p>{% endif %}\n\t<p class=\"mb-5\" style=\"color: #5a7390; font-size: 15px;\">Admissions, inscriptions et espace étudiant</p>\n\n\t<div class=\"w-100 mb-5\" style=\"max-width: 680px;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row g-3\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 d-flex flex-column\" style=\"gap: 12px;\">\n\t\t\t\t{% if infos.etat == 'ouverte' %}\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/candidature/new\" class=\"btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-white fw-semibold border-0 rounded-4 py-3\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #003B6F 0%, #1f6feb 100%); font-size: 15px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,59,111,0.25);\">Déposer une candidature</a>\n\t\t\t\t{% else %}\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center fw-semibold rounded-4 py-3\" style=\"color:#6b7a90; background:#eef2f7; border:1px solid #cbd9e8; font-size:15px; cursor:not-allowed;\" title=\"Candidatures fermées\">Candidatures fermées</span>\n\t\t\t\t{% endif %}\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/mon-dossier\" class=\"btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center fw-semibold rounded-4 py-3\" style=\"color:#003B6F; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #cbd9e8; font-size:15px;\">Suivre mon dossier</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 d-flex flex-column\" style=\"gap: 12px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/mon-dossier\" class=\"btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center fw-semibold rounded-4 py-3\" style=\"color:#003B6F; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #cbd9e8; font-size:15px;\">Admis : finaliser mon inscription</a>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/login\" class=\"btn w-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center fw-semibold rounded-4 py-3\" style=\"color:#003B6F; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #cbd9e8; font-size:15px;\">Espace étudiant (connexion)</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"w-100 pt-4 border-top\" style=\"max-width: 820px; border-color:#e2e4e9 !important;\">\n\t\t<p class=\"fw-semibold mb-4\" style=\"color:#003B6F; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:12px;\">Comment ça marche</p>\n\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-start justify-content-center\" style=\"gap: 36px;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\" style=\"max-width: 170px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle fw-semibold mb-3\" style=\"width: 38px; height: 38px; background:#EAF1F8; color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">1</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"fw-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">Déposez votre candidature</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#6b7a90; line-height:1.6; font-size:12.5px;\">Trois choix de formation et vos pièces justificatives. Vous recevez un numéro de dossier.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\" style=\"max-width: 170px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle fw-semibold mb-3\" style=\"width: 38px; height: 38px; background:#EAF1F8; color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">2</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"fw-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">Concours ou étude de dossier</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#6b7a90; line-height:1.6; font-size:12.5px;\">Selon la formation demandée, vous êtes convoqué(e) au concours ou votre dossier est étudié.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\" style=\"max-width: 170px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle fw-semibold mb-3\" style=\"width: 38px; height: 38px; background:#EAF1F8; color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">3</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"fw-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">Confirmez votre place</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#6b7a90; line-height:1.6; font-size:12.5px;\">Admis(e) : confirmez dans le délai indiqué sur « Mon dossier » et remplissez votre inscription.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column align-items-center text-center\" style=\"max-width: 170px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center rounded-circle fw-semibold mb-3\" style=\"width: 38px; height: 38px; background:#EAF1F8; color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">4</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"fw-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:#003B6F; font-size:13px;\">Accédez à votre espace</p>\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#6b7a90; line-height:1.6; font-size:12.5px;\">Connectez-vous avec votre matricule : grille, planning, notes et réinscription.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n",
